sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Controller as StatisticsController
    participant Service as StatisticsService
    participant StatisticsDao as StatisticsDao
    participant DeliveryDao as DeliveryDao
    participant JobDao as JobDao

    Note over User, JobDao: 个人求职者统计
    User->>Controller: 进入"我的统计"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取个人数据统计
    activate Service

    %% 统计投递
    Service->>Service: 统计投递数量
    activate Service
    Service->>DeliveryDao: 统计用户投递记录数
    activate DeliveryDao
    DeliveryDao-->>Service: 投递总数
    deactivate DeliveryDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回投递数
    deactivate Service

    %% 统计面试
    Service->>Service: 统计面试邀约数量
    activate Service
    Service->>DeliveryDao: 统计status='INTERVIEW'的记录
    activate DeliveryDao
    DeliveryDao-->>Service: 邀约数量
    deactivate DeliveryDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回邀约数
    deactivate Service

    %% 统计收藏
    Service->>Service: 统计收藏职位数量
    activate Service
    Service->>JobDao: 统计用户收藏记录数
    activate JobDao
    JobDao-->>Service: 收藏数量
    deactivate JobDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回收藏数
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 组装统计结果DTO
    Service-->>Controller: 返回个人统计数据
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>User: 展示统计卡片<br/>(投递X次/邀约X次/收藏X个)
    deactivate Controller